            "review_title": "Review at 1988 Coffee & Bar",
            "review_text": "Kate W\n14 contributions\n0\nEscaping the rain!\nJul 2023 • Couples\nWe decided to come here after my partner found out about it online. We picked a very rainy day in Halong Bay so coming to shelter from the weather but still getting a beautiful roof top view was great! The food was lovely and not expensive for lunch and the drinks were also lovely, the hot chocolate was just what I needed after being out in the wind and rain. I’d definitely come again on a sunny day as I know the view will be even more stunning\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten July 18, 2023",
            "rating": 5.0,
